%% caption: How our changes get into the game. We never rebuild Simitone: small programs rewrite specific methods inside the released game files, and tests check the result.
flowchart LR
  ZIP["Released game<br/>SimitoneWindows.zip v0.8.12"]
  PAT["Patchers (Tools/)<br/>rewrite specific methods"]
  HOOK["Hook libraries<br/>SpriteCards.dll, SimTestHook.dll"]
  APP["Patched game folder"]
  TOOL["simtool<br/>screenshots and test input"]
  TEST["Automated tests<br/>unit, patch, end-to-end"]
  CI["GitHub Actions<br/>runs tests on every push"]
  ZIP -->|is read by| PAT
  PAT -->|writes patched DLLs into| APP
  HOOK -->|is called by| APP
  TOOL -->|drives and photographs| APP
  TEST -->|check| PAT
  TEST -->|check| APP
  CI -->|runs| TEST
